  &lt;body>
    &lt;p>
&lt;b>The SKOS&amp;#160;class es based on the imported SKOS&amp;#160;&lt;/b>&lt;a href="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core">skos.rdf&lt;/a>&lt;a href="http://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/skos.rdf"> &lt;/a>&lt;b>showing annotations on attributes&lt;/b>

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
Note that skos.rdf appears as 'core' under Imported Ontologies in the model containment tree because this is the name assigned by the SKOS namespace URI &lt;a href="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#&lt;/a>

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
&amp;#160;

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
Annotations are only displayed for attributes of classes on this diagram. For annotations relating to the classes themselves or association properties.

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
&amp;#160;

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
For the metamodel with annotations relating to classes ahd relationships see:&amp;#160;&lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1690291178165_921277_12645" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">SKOS Metamodel - Per RDF classes and associations (with class and association annotations)&lt;/a>.

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
For a clean version of the metamodel with no annotations, but full information on attributes of classes see, see:&amp;#160;&lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1690356181062_866625_11199" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE"&gt;SKOS Metamodel - Per RDF classes and associations (no annotations)&lt;/a>

    &lt;/p>

